# terminal.d/data/codebase.list
# The one list of work: karsh.page/codebase renders it, and the terminal's
# codebase screen reads it from here.
# name | kind | year | url | tags | description
#
# kind is the page section: projects or scripts. The terminal shows only
# projects; scripts it installs from scripts.list instead. Rows appear in file
# order within their kind. Tags are comma-separated. No field may contain "|".
switchboard.nvim           | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/switchboard.nvim | Lua, Neovim, tmux | One keybind, different actions. Binds per-project automations to a single key.
tmux-telemetry             | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/tmux-telemetry | Go, tmux | Keeps a log of where the working day goes, from tmux session, window and pane switches, without changing how you work.
datakrash                  | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/datakrash | Python, systemd, ntfy | Tracks your activity across services and, when you go quiet, checks in over ntfy before alerting a contact.
osc52pty                   | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/osc52pty | Go, macOS | Workaround that brings OSC 52 clipboard copying to Terminal.app.
AnonSurf-plus              | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/AnonSurf-plus | macOS, Tor | Parrot OS's AnonSurf for macOS, routing the system's traffic through Tor.
OpenNetics - Capture-SRM   | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/OpenNetics/Capture-SRM | Python, Qt, SciPy, NumPy | Reads raw sensor values over serial, records gestures and builds machine learning models from them.
tokyoburn.nvim             | projects | 2024 | https://github.com/karnull/tokyoburn.nvim | Lua, Neovim | Red-themed fork of folke/tokyonight.nvim.
only-tmux.nvim             | projects | 2024 | https://github.com/karnull/only-tmux.nvim | Lua, Neovim, tmux | A Neovim keybind for :only that works on tmux panes too.
tnotify                    | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/tnotify | Go, tmux | Notifications shown as a tmux overlay.
ifdef.nvim                 | projects | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/ifdef.nvim | Lua, Neovim, C/C++ | Maps nested #ifdef blocks in C and C++ files, with a tree view and labels for matching #endif lines.
trash                      | projects | 2024 | https://github.com/karnull/trash | Go | Deletes files to the system trash, lists what's there and restores them by ID.
smonitor                   | projects | 2025 | https://github.com/karnull/smonitor | C++, Arduino, Serial Communication | Terminal serial monitor with timestamps and saving straight to file.
fetch                      | projects | 2021 | https://github.com/karnull/fetch | Shell | Collection of minimal system fetch scripts.
git_fuzzy.sh               | scripts  | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/git_fuzzy.sh | Git, Shell, fzf | Fuzzy pickers for everyday git chores - branches, worktrees, stashes and staging.
git_logs.sh                | scripts  | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/git_logs.sh | Git, Shell, fzf | A tidier git log, with a coloured commit graph and fzf actions on picked commits.
namedit.sh                 | scripts  | 2025 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/namedit.sh | Workflow, Shell, ffmpeg | Mass-renames files in your $EDITOR, and converts them with ffmpeg when the extension changes.
copy_code.sh               | scripts  | 2024 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/copy_code.sh | Workflow, Shell | Copies every source file of a given type to the clipboard in one go.
vimacro.sh                 | scripts  | 2024 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/vimacro.sh | Workflow, Shell, Vim | Vim macros in the shell: record a sequence of edits and replay it across input.
rmsymlink.sh               | scripts  | 2025 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/rmsymlink.sh | Workflow, Shell | Removes a symbolic link together with the file it points to.
watch_file.sh              | scripts  | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/watch_file.sh | Monitoring, Shell | Tails a file and sends a notification when new content is added.
colors.sh                  | scripts  | 2023 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/colors.sh | Reference, Shell | Prints every terminal colour alongside its escape sequence.
periodic.sh                | scripts  | 2023 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/periodic.sh | Reference, Shell | Renders the periodic table in the terminal, colour-coded by group.
battery_cap.sh             | scripts  | 2021 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/battery_cap.sh | Maintenance, Shell, systemd | Caps a laptop's maximum charge with a systemd service, on supported models.
refresh.sh                 | scripts  | 2022 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/refresh.sh | Maintenance, Shell | Drops system caches and reports memory usage before and after.
disk_usage_summary.sh      | scripts  | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/disk_usage_summary.sh | Monitoring, Shell | Lists the directories and files taking up the most disk space.
monitor_temp.sh            | scripts  | 2026 | https://github.com/karnull/gists/blob/main/monitor_temp.sh | Monitoring, Shell | Watches CPU and GPU temperatures and alerts when they pass a threshold.
