template-cxx               | templates | 2026 | https://github.com/karshosphere/template-cxx | Copier, C/C++ | Copier template for my C and C++ projects.
template-rs                | templates | 2026 | https://github.com/karshosphere/template-rs | Copier, Rust | Copier template for my Rust projects.
